  "title": "Coconut Mango Muffins with Candied Ginger",
  "description": "A sweet combination of dried mango and candied ginger flavors this delicious muffin. The coconut sprinkled on top gives an extra crunch and a lovely appearance.",
  "authors": [
    "brittneyart"
  ],
